# Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) produce CRLF working-tree copies.
# Bash scripts with CRLF fail at runtime on Linux ("set: pipefail: invalid
# option name") and cannot be executed directly under WSL/Git Bash, which
# breaks local runs of the QSL staging operator tests. Blob content for these
# files is already LF; pinning eol=lf only changes checkout behavior and keeps
# local Windows runs consistent with CI and with the VPS-installed operator.
*.sh text eol=lf
